    "about": {
      "description": "lgpio provides Python bindings for the lg library to control the GPIO\nof Linux single-board computers such as the Raspberry Pi through the\n/dev/gpiochip character devices. It supports reading and writing GPIO\nlines, alerts/callbacks on level changes, software PWM and waves, as\nwell as I2C, SPI, and serial communication. This build statically\nlinks liblgpio, so no system lg installation is required.",
      "dev_url": "https://github.com/joan2937/lg",
      "home": "http://abyz.me.uk/lg/py_lgpio.html",
      "license": "Unlicense",
